# The Settings shot: LoRa, which is the section that says what this client is for.
#
# The index above it is a column of chevrons; this is the screen with the controls on it - a
# region, a preset, a hop limit on the scale of the hop limits it could have had, a transmit
# switch and a power reading the scale cannot place.
#
# `clock` is what makes this file a screenshot rather than a picture of when it was taken: the
# seeded log and the clock column both come from it, so re-rendering next month produces the
# same bytes and `git status` stays quiet unless the UI actually moved.
scene demo
scale 4
clock 2026-01-12 19:12
config
tab settings
key down 7
key a
